(c4) <sp>V/</sp>. 1. Be(dc)á(ixf!gw!hgh/giHG/gf;ixf!gw!hgh/giHG/gf,hj/jjj/kvJH)ti(h;) quo(h)rum(hg) re(f)mís(fh/jhj)sae(g) sunt(fgFED/f;) in(d)i(ffe)qui(fhg/hvGF)tá(fgf)tes(f:) et(fd~) quo(fgf)rum(ghg~) te(hvfh!jv)cta(g) sunt(fgFED/f) pec(d)cá(fvfff/gf/gff)ta.(dfDC/d) (::)
<sp>V/</sp>. 2. Pro(f) hac(ghgg/fhg/fgFE/C/dfddd) o(ff)rá(gd/gf/gff)bit(fc;) ad(d) te(gf/fd/gvfgf/fd/ced/ddd;) o(d/fff/fgfg)mnis(d) san(d!ewf!gv)ctus(gf/gf/fe) (;) in(g) tém(g/jjj)po(hhg)re(gf/gff/ded;) op(df)por(df)tú(fff/hvGF/hvGF/gd)no:(d:) ve(d)rúm(ff)ta(hjh/hg)men(gf/gff/ded;) in(ff) di(h)lú(jj)vi(kjjvIHG)o(hg) a(g)quá(hg/gf/gff)rum(ed,) mul(ff)tá(hjHG/gf;ixhjHG/ih)rum(h;) ad(fg/hg) e(g/jjjvHG;ixjjjvIHG/hg/hifg)um(d;) non(ff) ap(f)pro(f)xi(g)má(gjHF/fd)bunt.(dfDC/d) (::)
* Et gloriámini.() (::)
